# Untitled

## Article Defining the Skeletal Myogenic Lineage in Human Pluripotent Stem Cell-Derived Teratomas
Citation: Pappas, M.P.; Xie, N.; Penaloza, J.S.; Chan, S.S.K. Defining the Skeletal Myogenic Lineage in Human Pluripotent Stem CellDerived Teratomas. Cells 2022, 11, 1589. https://doi.org/10.3390/ cells11091589
